MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bb50b23a4cf2d8b458c5808c80931e04, type: 3}
  m_Name: 3DAYSLEFT AAA
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Game.Dialogue.DialogueNode
  speakerName: Oryctola
  dialogueType: 2
  advanceDialogueDatabase: 1
  lines:
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1196278bb2e7134498a336c18461fd65, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: Then you have no business trying to trample on my reasons.
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: a969c6cf5888b5e47b18c98739fba120, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: Maybe you're the one who should try meditating. Haha. Then you'd see that
      you have no ground to stand on whatsoever.
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8f2961def0ed6a048bab3643fe75a48e, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: You keep trying to paint a world that doesn't exist anymore.
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8f2961def0ed6a048bab3643fe75a48e, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: Whatever the bunnies are occupying themselves with are a desperate attempt
      to forget and survive. To brandish it as something "liveable" and that they're
      "content" in it is a false illusion.
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8f2961def0ed6a048bab3643fe75a48e, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: I'm done being bothered by you now.
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1196278bb2e7134498a336c18461fd65, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c24a7b4c4ab702e40ad119184336e7ae, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: Do NOT come back here!
    typingSpeed: 1.48
  ChoicePortraits: []
  ChoicePortraitAnimationFPS: 8
